<title>USA: Staples &quot;evaluating&quot; whether to fight FTC.</title>
<headline>Staples &quot;evaluating&quot; whether to fight FTC.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-04-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Staples Inc is evaluating whether to fight in court against the Federal Trade Commission decision rejecting its merger with Office Depot Inc, a spokesman for Staples said Friday.</p>
<p>&quot;We are evaluating whether to fight this. We have to see precisely what the FTC has said and need to take it under consideration with the board of Staples,&quot; said Todd Krasnow. &quot;Obviously we're both astonished and terribly dissappointed.&quot;</p>
<p>He said the board of Office Depot would make a similar decision.</p>
<p>Before this, Office Depot had said for certain that it intended to fight the FTC in court.</p>
</text>
